Cell["\<\
Define the relaxation Lindblad stuff (this is slow. I\[CloseCurlyQuote]ve \
pasted the result into notebook so if you can, skip this part and pass the \
paste result on)\
\>", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.734978400857793*^9, 3.734978436288048*^9}, {
  3.7349786051179237`*^9, 3.73497860898003*^9}, {3.735064381784536*^9, 
